                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/2912: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Harrison</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-08-03T18:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 3,
                                1920—6 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 10:18
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>1499. Your 1320, July 31st, 6 p.m. In accordance with your request Foreign Office
                    made no announcement.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Harrison</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
